  "body": "### What problem are you trying to solve?\n\nIf you're trying to build a customizable select which closes its picker when pressing a specific key, such as \"q\", you'd have to remove and re-append the select element or open and then hide another popover=auto somewhere in the document. It would be better if there was an explicit API like showPicker(), but for hiding the picker.\n\n### What solutions exist today?\n\nRemoving and re-appending the element or opening and closing another popover=auto somewhere in the document.\n\n### How would you solve it?\n\nAdd a new method named hidePicker() to the select element and possibly every element which already supports showPicker().\n\n### Anything else?\n\n_No response_",
